      "label": "Health and pension insurance",
      "group": "social",
      "note": "11.55% (pension 8.50%, health 2.80%, cash sickness benefits 0.25%) of pay up to five times the minimum wage: €13,518.68 a month to May and €13,856.63 from June 2026 (€164,589.81 for the year).",
